  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (D): Under IRC Section 6601, interest on underpayments runs from the return due date (without regard to extensions) to the date of payment. Section 6622 requires daily compounding at the federal short-term rate plus 3 percentage points, adjusted quarterly.
Wrong (A): Personal interest on tax underpayments is not deductible for individual taxpayers under IRC Section 163(h).
