  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (B): Under Restatement (Second) of Contracts Section 14, a minor (person under 18) may disaffirm contracts for non-necessities at any time during minority or within a reasonable time after reaching majority. Jones, at 16, may void the $2,000 contract for a non-essential item.
Wrong (A): Partial performance does not bar a minor''s right to disaffirm; the power to void exists regardless of performance status.
