  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (D): Under Restatement (Second) of Contracts Section 360, specific performance is available when monetary damages are inadequate because the subject matter is unique. Real property is presumed unique under Section 360(b), making specific performance routinely available for land sale contracts like Thornton''s brownstone.
Wrong (A): Specific performance is denied for standard commodities available on the open market, since damages can cover a replacement purchase.
